New in 0.11.0
• Automatic backup: turn it on in Backup & restore, and your records back up daily while charging on Wi-Fi.
• Log a meal in one tap: add the "Log a meal" tile to your quick settings and record the moment without opening the app.
• The month view in Insights now has the rhythm chart too — a whole month's shape at a glance.
• A year ago today: if that day last year holds records, Insights quietly brings it back.
• The photo wall now opens to the whole period, not just 12.
